<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.28 vs   1.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.03 vs   1.79</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.83 vs   1.63</p>
<p> Sales		   13.51 vs  11.90</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.55 vs   2.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.25 vs   3.60</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.93 vs   3.45</p>
<p> Sales		   29.25 vs  24.83</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paintmaker is Polifarb Wroclaw</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
